%!PS
% SPDX-FileCopyrightText: 2026 EfterScript contributors
% SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
% Scenario: gsave/grestore does not bloat the IR. Fifty pairs that
% change settings and restore them, then one fill: the page holds
% exactly one paint operation and no save/restore churn.
50 { gsave 3 setlinewidth 0.5 setgray grestore } repeat
0 0 moveto 10 0 lineto 10 10 lineto closepath fill
showpage
